# No Prefab Generator Scripts

- Do not create or propose one-off/editor/runtime scripts whose purpose is generating prefabs.
- Prefer direct prefab creation/editing in Unity assets instead of code-driven prefab generation.
- If a prefab is requested, produce the prefab asset/config directly (or document the exact manual inspector setup) without generator scripts.

## Examples

```text
Bad: "I wrote an editor script that creates this prefab for you."
Good: "I created/updated the prefab asset directly and wired its serialized fields."
```
